{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1683.unity3d","item_key":"commands[1].text","source_sha256":"944a3c196d2b2467500ff199a2e66dc21a0f797fd3c2bed35256ed0ccbdfdd89","ja":"ヒーローのヒーロー！！","zh":"英雄的英雄！！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1683.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"da181057b3cee238fbfe55460ad0399fbb25c5e8614a860ee7f0f1af4a3de3fe","ja":"「まだ電車は動かないのか？」\n「はい、もう少しかかりそうで……」","zh":"“电车还没恢复运行吗？”\n“是的，看来还要再花点时间……”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1683.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"ada7167d2e43dd89f221c4527acbf59756f47eb4b62e95237c988dce1c8fd760","ja":"あの、スタッフさん、突然すみません。\n何か私たちにお手伝いできることってありますか？","zh":"那个，工作组的各位，不好意思突然打扰。\n有什么我们能帮得上忙的事吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1683.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d60b178018e823966d49d2df6bd9140dfb3a20aae5c2e06def17899f4cb70ddc","ja":"「えっ……あ、もしかして、\nアイドルの百合子ちゃんと瑞希ちゃん！？」","zh":"“哎……啊，难道说，\n是偶像百合子和小瑞希！？”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1683.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"6ca01766e52d11f8c4b48686c67be2327b8ddcc1e2ef9baf18dcc74c8e9d20b3","ja":"はい。皆さんお待ちなので、何かできればと。\nところで、なにがあったのでしょう？","zh":"是的。大家都在等着，如果能帮上什么忙就好了。\n话说回来，发生什么事了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1683.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"890178cc028a6532680ce71ce70696b54f18e56d1b2afa148c4a27e4c730648a","ja":"「実は……電車の遅延で、アクターの到着が\n遅れてしまっていて。それでどうしたものかと」","zh":"「其实……因为电车延误，皮套演员的到达\n时间推迟了。所以正发愁该怎么办呢」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1683.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"2e41e7895ecd699a8d8152ed348b8b527a3d79f5e464cd8af45901ff73402ed8","ja":"でしたら、私たちが\nステージに立ってみるのはどうでしょう！？","zh":"既然这样，不如由我们\n试着登上舞台，大家觉得怎么样！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1683.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"8ebb69e5c049f4ac8af629e732daa7e295bf70ea695f1e7256fe5a5b3e8d6e25","ja":"こう見えて私たちは、ヒーローや\n悪の怪人をした経験があるのです。……いぇい。","zh":"别看我们这样，其实也是演过英雄和\n邪恶怪人的哦。……耶。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1683.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"7edd6fa33b7298efd36e4313471105214832d7b618610b8d7e9fd041a5c8cea2","ja":"「い、いいんですか！？\nすぐ上の者に確認してきます！」","zh":"「真、真的可以吗！？\n我这就去向上级确认！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1683.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e","ja":"そして……","zh":"然后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1683.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"110ddda7b4e75ff529c81ddeab85124bcf22081468e3428419a5dc50d4ff5976","ja":"「あ、おねえちゃんたちだ！」","zh":"“啊，是大姐姐们！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1683.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"f139647d5c409d339f6fe30a3ab97d7f27a31df0c70c4b58ec9ad543c349e0f1","ja":"みんな、こんにちは～！　レッドたちはね、\n今一生懸命、他の場所で戦ってるの！","zh":"大家，你好呀～！小红她们啊，\n现在正在别的地方拼尽全力战斗呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1683.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"8657b3ee905be2a735986a692c0817ef1a5746d2f299e77785a51fc3546ab01b","ja":"なので、私たちは歌で応援しましょう。","zh":"所以，我们就用歌声来为他们加油吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1683.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"bcc4323660041f9142469bfc5b93208aa017f978896704ec67b8b1889f5d0e41","ja":"テーマソングをみんなで歌って、\nヒーローたちに届けるのです。","zh":"大家一起唱响主题曲，\n传递给英雄们吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1683.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"06d90591381faa84223d2bf94a9d7d271d2b3d5473e22acfd66ca5d86b78f786","ja":"ワアァァァァァァァッ！","zh":"哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1683.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"8d5b2d4916dc49782b2dbf64fcecd8415e3d0430b751b716fd8f3838583958c1","ja":"そのあとも、歌とヒーローについてのトークで\n子どもたちを盛り上げて……","zh":"之后也用关于歌曲和英雄的闲聊\n让孩子们兴奋起来……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1683.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"4422481ffc13bf569de13e37f5517fe75c9977e88c29bc21cb6a3c6c9ae2ea5e","ja":"「アクターの皆さん、到着して準備もできました！\nいつでも出られます！」","zh":"“演员们已经到达，准备工作也做好了！\n随时可以出场！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1683.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"8a5cf6836fe0251b4581fb009a8be55d2227a26b4b52d73343a111bab4147885","ja":"わかりました、ありがとうございます。","zh":"知道了，谢谢。","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1683.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"a231ebfe27c4153b47cb94e02a1250c9e90d9027374c3271fb286361d454c91a","ja":"みんなの応援が、レッドたちの力になったよ！\nもうすぐここに来てくれるからね！","zh":"大家的支持，已经化为红队大家的力量了哦！\n他们马上就会来这里的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1683.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"cd2d69926bca1b6ad34281cecbf97df3631e9afef8962104f3c6a9ff6dd1c22f","ja":"さあ、みんなで彼らを呼びましょう。\n……せーの。","zh":"来，大家一起呼唤他们吧。\n……预备——","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1683.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"c3efec862e00002f5ac97526ab26c4479db5bf1b0addebbe1edbcc31d919bf1c","ja":"「レッド～！」「ブルー！」「イエロー！」\n「ブラック～！」「ピンク～！」","zh":"“红～！”“蓝！”“黄！”\n“黑～！”“粉～！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1683.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"44c63869ad1216d5ce31e9fc7a5e49009af661a34fb63969caf573c90fafd350","ja":"ふふ、無事に始まってよかったですね。","zh":"呵呵，能顺利开始真是太好了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1683.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"e1d1d76a78e3f5a1baed2ca18f413117fdb9f9a1727b22054ed1cfe154fb3c4d","ja":"はい。アドリブにしてはなかなかだったかと。\n……それではここからは、観客として楽しみましょう。","zh":"是的。作为即兴发挥来说，表现得挺不错了。\n……那么接下来，就作为观众好好享受吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1683.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"972ff375d6a67a4cbc4243dd3a495fc76553af26a2010fc6133b6a0ca1a92419","ja":"頑張れ～～！　レッド～～～～！","zh":"加油～～！　红战士～～～～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
